WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.480
A shipwreck.

2
00:00:01.530 --> 00:00:05.460
A young woman is washed up
alone on a strange shore.

3
00:00:05.510 --> 00:00:08.500
Her twin, she thinks, has drowned.

4
00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:11.770
She asks the captain:
"Conceal me what I am,

5
00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:13.580
and be my aid".

6
00:00:13.630 --> 00:00:17.760
Soon she is Cesario, a
young man serving a duke.

7
00:00:17.810 --> 00:00:19.030
She falls for the duke.

8
00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:21.630
But she can't say a word of it.

9
00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:24.800
Then he sends her to woo
another woman for him.

10
00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:27.070
Why not just tell him the truth?

11
00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:30.000
In this mission, you'll
see what Viola faces,

12
00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:31.820
alone in Illyria.

13
00:00:31.870 --> 00:00:36.310
You'll learn how dramatic irony
lets us know what Orsino doesn't.

14
00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:41.760
And you'll hear her tell him the story
of a sister who "never told her love".

15
00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:45.720
Your mission: explain why
Viola stays in disguise.
